dsh-workspace-hide README · Usage：1. Install, then restart DSH Desktop;
2. Open **Settings**; the left rail shows **"Workspace visibility"**
   (right after "Archived sessions"). The rail is too narrow for the full wording, so the
   rail label is short while the panel title still spells it out:
   "Workspaces shown in the sidebar";
3. Each row has a switch on the right — **on = shown in the sidebar, off = hidden and its
   sessions archived**. A row you switch off sinks to the bottom of the list and shows
   "N sessions archived";
4. The header reads "N total · N shown · N hidden", and **"Show all"** clears the whole
   list and restores everything at once.

